                                     centred row that shoved everything to its
                                     right - the volume slider visibly wobbled
                                     while the position bar was being dragged
                                     (2026-08-09). The twin carries the widest
                                     shape this readout can take. -->
                                <Grid x:Name="ViewerMediaTimeBox"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Margin="{DynamicResource ViewerChipGroupMargin}">
                                    <!-- Now two digits of hours, since the
                                         readout stopped dropping them (see
                                         FormatDuration). The twin has to carry
                                         the shape the real one can reach or the
